  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Making positive sexual and reproductive health and education outcomes a reality for young people in Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our Rights, Our Lives, Our Future Malawi will contribute to and align with the Regional O3 program supported by the Governments of Sweden, Ireland and France. O3 Malawi aligns with UNESCO&apos;s vision of a world where gender equality in and through education is achieved, ensuring girls and boys, women and men have equal rights and opportunities for education and empowerment, and the power and agency to shape their lives and futures.</narrative>
